1
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:10,974
Hi. Hi, yeah. I'm on the train.

2
00:01:18,138 --> 00:01:19,750
Just leaving the office now.

3
00:01:32,404 --> 00:01:34,750
Long day. The Henley account. Again.

4
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:44,500
Was that the brakes?

5
00:01:48,913 --> 00:01:50,900
No, don't wait up. Love you.

6
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Yeah?

7
00:02:23,181 --> 00:02:24,750
I'm at the library, Mum.

8
00:02:31,952 --> 00:02:35,000
No, that's — it's the library. They're doing work on the —

9
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,000
<i>Kai?</i>

10
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:42,400
<i>Kai?</i>

11
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,500
What — where did he —

12
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Hey.

13
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,000
Hey!

14
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:27,500
That's insane.

15
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:36,500
My name is Noor.

16
00:03:44,048 --> 00:03:45,600
My name is S—

17
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
<i>Kai?</i>

18
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:27,500
<i>Kai?</i>

19
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,000
You okay?

20
00:04:54,499 --> 00:04:55,500
I'm f—

21
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,600
I'm not fine.

22
00:05:01,500 --> 00:05:04,759
Me neither. I haven't slept in two days.

23
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,148
You've seen this before.

24
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,564
I ride it every night.

25
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Why?

26
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:30,416
My wife was ill a long time. Everyone told me she'd be fine.
Doctors. Her sister. Me, to her.

27
00:05:33,016 --> 00:05:36,407
This is the only place nobody can say that to me.

28
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,250
Nobody said anything.

29
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,553
It isn't only what you say.

30
00:06:57,639 --> 00:06:59,250
Whatever it is, say it.

31
00:07:06,474 --> 00:07:08,000
- I can't —
- Say it.

32
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,000
He's asking.

33
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:37,500
Mark.

34
00:07:38,565 --> 00:07:41,750
No. Listen. I'm not leaving the office.

35
00:07:44,575 --> 00:07:49,750
I haven't been to the office since September. They let me go. The whole floor.

36
00:07:55,009 --> 00:07:58,846
I get dressed and I get on the train and I go to the library —

37
00:07:59,046 --> 00:08:02,750
— and I sit there. All day. And then I come home.

38
00:08:09,361 --> 00:08:12,700
I didn't tell you because you'd have been kind about it, and I couldn't —

39
00:08:23,033 --> 00:08:24,033
I'm sorry.

40
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,932
<i>Thank you for riding quietly.</i>
